---
---

<section id="about" class="section bg-white">
  <div class="container-site grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow mb-4">About</p>
      <h2 class="text-h2">A safe pair of hands</h2>
      <div class="mt-5 space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
        <p>
          North Point Digital is a UK engineering consultancy. Our consultants
          have spent the last decade inside enterprise cloud estates as
          architects, SREs and software engineers, so we know what things cost,
          where the money leaks, and which parts of a platform wake people up at
          night.
        </p>
        <p>
          You buy our time, scoped in writing. Every engagement is staffed with
          senior people, and you know who is on it before it starts.
        </p>
        <p>
          North Point Digital is an official AWS Partner. The AI and software
          work draws on the same engineering, pointed at your business.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm" data-reveal>
      <video
        controls
        playsinline
        preload="metadata"
        class="block h-auto w-full"
        data-track-video="About Us Video"
      >
        <source src="/about-video.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
        Your browser does not support the video tag.
      </video>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script is:inline>
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-track-video]').forEach(function (video) {
    var name = video.dataset.trackVideo;
    function send(event) {
      if (typeof window.gtag === 'function') {
        window.gtag('event', event, { event_category: 'media', event_label: name, video_name: name });
      }
    }
    video.addEventListener('play', function () { send('video_play'); });
    video.addEventListener('pause', function () { send('video_pause'); });
    video.addEventListener('ended', function () { send('video_complete'); });
  });
</script>
